      "text": "(2) The employer shall distribute portable fire extinguishers for use by employees on Class A fires so that the travel distance for employees to any extinguisher is 75 feet (22.9 m) or less.\n\n",
      "claim_ids": [
        "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:9132d6af3914b91342cf1d96a2d165df8ab7819eb9fbfb1f78a7bd8011cab4f9"
      ],
      "evidence_refs": [
