      "text": "(4) The employer shall distribute portable fire extinguishers for use by employees on Class B fires so that the travel distance from the Class B hazard area to any extinguisher is 50 feet (15.2 m) or less.\n\n",
      "claim_ids": [],
      "evidence_refs": [
        {
          "id": "urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A5d3d4365a7e56c25fd7ccacb7f4fe63129f97cd8ab4523042c0ce9159b1b2afa:3716:3923:sha256-977ed08a260096823ce5fa32e54593ac96f0edcf417727164fe1396b3120e3b1",
