      "statement": "For employee-use portable extinguishers to which paragraph (c) applies, excluding workplaces exempt under (b)(1) and the non-employee-use situation in (a) where only (e) and (f) apply, the employer shall assure they are fully charged and operable and kept in designated places at all times.",
