      "statement": "Where an employer has an emergency action plan meeting section 1910.38 that designates certain employees as the only authorized users of available portable fire extinguishers and requires all other employees in the fire area to immediately evacuate the affected work area when the fire alarm sounds, the employer is exempt from paragraph (d) distribution requirements.",
